{
  "uid": "eiaf-cdc",
  "title": "CDC — Outbox",
  "tags": [
    "eiaf",
    "cdc",
    "INT-SALES-002"
  ],
  "description": "注文のイベント(INT-SALES-002)の発行(Outbox → Debezium → Kafka)の監視。レプリケーションスロットの遅延と上限までの残り、コネクタの状態、アラート。P06 ④。対応は docs/runbooks/cdc-outbox-lag.md。",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "レプリケーションスロット(order の Outbox)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "保持している WAL(遅延)と警告の閾値",
      "description": "スロットが読み終えていない WAL の量(pg_wal_lsn_diff = 今の WAL の位置 − restart_lsn)。上限(max_slot_wal_keep_size)の 25% を超えた状態が 5 分続くと CdcSlotLagHigh(warning)。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "pg_replication_slots_pg_wal_lsn_diff{slot_name=\"order_outbox\"}",
          "legendFormat": "保持している WAL"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "0.25 * pg_settings_max_slot_wal_keep_size_bytes > 0",
          "legendFormat": "警告の閾値(上限の 25%)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "上限までの残り(safe_wal_size)",
      "description": "スロットが無効になる(wal_status=lost)までに書ける WAL の量。上限の 25% を切ると CdcSlotWalAtRisk(warning)。対応は docs/runbooks/cdc-outbox-lag.md。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "pg_replication_slots_safe_wal_size_bytes{slot_name=\"order_outbox\"}",
          "legendFormat": "残り"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "pg_settings_max_slot_wal_keep_size_bytes > 0",
          "legendFormat": "上限(max_slot_wal_keep_size)"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "0.25 * pg_settings_max_slot_wal_keep_size_bytes > 0",
          "legendFormat": "警告の閾値(上限の 25%)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "スロットの状態(wal_status・使用中)",
      "description": "wal_status は reserved が正常。extended / unreserved は警告、lost は重大(CdcSlotLost)。使用中が 0 ならコネクタが接続していない(CdcConnectorDown)。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "pg_replication_slots_wal_status{slot_name=\"order_outbox\"} == 1",
          "legendFormat": "wal_status={{wal_status}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "pg_replication_slots_slot_is_active{slot_name=\"order_outbox\"}",
          "legendFormat": "使用中"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Kafka Connect(Debezium)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "コネクタとタスクの状態",
      "description": "running が 1。それ以外(stopped / paused / failed / unassigned)が 1 分続くと CdcConnectorDown(critical)。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "kafka_connect_connector_status{connector=\"order-outbox\"} == 1",
          "legendFormat": "コネクタ {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "kafka_connect_connector_task_status{connector=\"order-outbox\"} == 1",
          "legendFormat": "タスク {{task}} {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Debezium のストリーミング",
      "description": "PostgreSQL へのレプリケーションの接続(1 = 接続中)と、最後のイベントからの経過時間。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "debezium_postgres_streaming_connected{server=\"order-outbox\"}",
          "legendFormat": "接続"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "debezium_postgres_streaming_millisecondssincelastevent{server=\"order-outbox\"} / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "最後のイベントからの秒数"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "発行したイベント(件 / 秒)",
      "description": "sales.order.created.v1 のオフセットの増え方(kafka-exporter)。注文の作成の件数とおおむね一致する。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic=\"sales.order.created.v1\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "sales.order.created.v1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "アラート",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CDC のアラート(firing / pending)",
      "description": "prometheus/rules/cdc.rules.yml。Alertmanager は置かないので、ここと Prometheus の /alerts で見る。平常時は空。",
      "datasource": {
